::  PLEAC chapter one, recipe one — the first gate a pilot writes. Stem law: gate-*-u32 stems accept one sample.
::  A bartis takes one typed sample from argv and answers with its double.
::  Shape proven by the corpus twin (STOA103 family); comments keep the
::  column law: full-line from character zero.
|=  sample=@u32
%-  double  sample
